      "$comment": "convertible and raw are bool?/int? in TabletModeService — null means ConvertibilityEnabled is not set and Windows is using default chassis detection. They were first declared non-null here because the capture came from a machine where the key happened to be set, and the mock guard caught it on its first run. See the note on capture in $comment at the top of this file."
    },
