      "$comment": "Almost everything is nullable and that is the feature, not laxness. cycleCount and cellTemperatureC are null on this board because the EC does not report them, each with a stated reason field — the alternative is printing '0 cycles' next to '91% health' and leaving the user to resolve it."
    },
